stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> StartupGate
  StartupGate --> StartupGate: persistence startup_hold
  StartupGate --> RestoredPhase: import already restored round
  StartupGate --> Pregame: ordinary fresh round
  Pregame --> Pregame: countdown paused / vote waits
  Pregame --> SettingUp: countdown reaches zero
  SettingUp --> Pregame: admission fails or save gate
  SettingUp --> SettingUp: startup hold yields/retries
  SettingUp --> RestoredPhase: import completes during admission
  SettingUp --> Playing: can_start or admin_started; create/equip; roundstart
  RestoredPhase --> Playing: saved active round resumed; no fresh seeding
  Playing --> Playing: persistence active clears finished
  Playing --> Playing: map.tick / events / gameplay
  Playing --> Finished: ticker.finished and normal round
  Finished --> Playing: persistence recheck becomes active
  Finished --> EndDelayed: admin delay_end
  Finished --> RebootPending: roundend hook and epoch-adjusted timeout
  RebootPending --> EndDelayed: admin delay_end before reboot
  RebootPending --> Playing: persistence recheck
  RebootPending --> RebootGate: world.Reboot
  RebootGate --> RebootBlocked: persistence owner/startup hold
  RebootGate --> [*]: permitted native reboot or supervisor request
  note right of RestoredPhase
    Diagram focuses saved active rounds.
    Imported phase interpretation is owned by persistence.
  end note
